receipts.text:
{
  "paper": "GOD AS ROOT - Long Edition",
  "core_relation": {
    "sentence": "Everything in this paper depends on the single Trinitarian God-axiom, from which all existence, distinction, relation, orientation, and the whole created order derive.",
    "quote": "**One axiom. Four debts paid. Everything else derives from this through formal grammar constrained by physics.** [S037, S038, S039]"
  },
  "product_test": {
    "answer": "multiplicative",
    "quote": "**One axiom. Four debts paid. Everything else derives from this through formal grammar constrained by physics.** [S037, S038, S039]",
    "reason": "The paper presents the Trinitarian God as the single axiom and ground; if that axiom is removed or zero, the entire framework of derivation, the four debts (existence, distinction, relation, orientation), and the consequent physics-theology mapping collapse. The language of 'everything else derives' and 'one axiom' is multiplicative: no axiom, no derivation."
  },
  "slots": [
    {
      "slot": "G",
      "plays_role": "God as the external negentropy influx, the necessary self-grounding source that sustains coherence and prevents collapse.",
      "quote": "If closed systems collapse and the universe has not collapsed, then something external sustains it. [S290]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "M",
      "plays_role": "Alignment with God, the reference, through love and perichoresis; coupling is strongest when aligned with the Trinitarian ground.",
      "quote": "Love: the ground state of the coupling between them. [S022]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "E",
      "plays_role": "Signal fidelity through the Logos/Word; truth that survives transmission, as in electromagnetism and information.",
      "quote": "In the beginning was the Logos, and the Logos was with God, and the Logos was God. [S371]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "S_eff",
      "plays_role": "Entropy as the Second Law that lowers coherence; closed systems decay and cannot reverse from within.",
      "quote": "The Second Law: entropy always increases in a closed system. You cannot cheat it. [S164, S165]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "T",
      "plays_role": "Time as the medium of covenant, sequence, and progressive revelation; temporal integration turns possibility into consequence.",
      "quote": "Time is not a prison. It is the medium of covenant. [S095, S096]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "K",
      "plays_role": "Compression through formal grammar and information theory; ordered meaning compresses, noise does not.",
      "quote": "Shannon gave us the mathematics to see what theology has always known: reality is made of meaning, not just matter. [S175]",
      "fit": "analogous"
    },
    {
      "slot": "R",
      "plays_role": "Phase transition at the cross and resurrection; thresholds where state changes, entropy is locally reversed, and restoration occurs.",
      "quote": "entropy -- the rule that everything falls apart when left alone -- gets locally reversed by connecting the system to a source outside itself. [S223]",
      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "Q",
      "plays_role": "Superposition in quantum mechanics as faith and open possibility; unresolved until actualized by choice.",
      "quote": "Quantum Mechanics | Faith | Agency -- faith can be withheld [S243]",
      "fit": "analogous"
    },
    {
      "slot": "F",
      "plays_role": "Non-local correlation through entanglement and coherence; related systems are not independent, as in the strong force and perichoresis.",
      "quote": "Confinement -- gets stronger as you pull apart. [S144]",
      "fit": "analogous"
    },
    {
      "slot": "C",
      "plays_role": "Integration in Christ as the convergence point and local integrator; coherence itself is mapped to Christ.",
      "quote": "Coherence | Christ | Agency -- coherence can be rejected [S245]",
      "fit": "direct"
    }
  ],
  "breaks": [
    "The paper treats agency as a necessary variable that the physics does not need but the spiritual reading does; this is an added factor with no slot in the master equation, and it is the repeated structural gap.",
    "The product test is multiplicative for the axiom, but the paper also allows for the possibility that the whole argument could be wrong, which introduces an additive or probabilistic element not captured by a strict product.",
    "The slot G is filled by God as external source, but the paper also says physics is not God and physics is the created medium; this creates a potential conflation between the source and the medium."
  ],
  "extra_factors": [
    "Agency: the capacity to accept or reject, which is the repeated missing piece in all ten mappings.",
    "The Cross-Resolution Method: a meta-method for testing claims across registers, which is not itself a factor in the equation but governs how factors are assessed.",
    "Progressive revelation: the idea that God builds a reference frame over time, which could be seen as a temporal modulation of E and T."
  ],
  "analog_strength": 4,
  "confidence": "medium",
  "one_line": "The paper's single Trinitarian axiom functions as a multiplicative ground analogous to the master equation's product of factors, with strong direct fits for G, M, E, S_eff, T, R, and C, and analogous fits for K, Q, and F, though agency appears as an extra factor not in the original equation.",
  "equations_present": false
}
